  "prefLabel": "Lot 6001.06 Disqualification and Forfeiture of a Prize",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 6001.06 Disqualification and Forfeiture of a Prize.\n\n(a) A potential winner shall be disqualified, and the prize forfeited when any of the following is true:\n\n(1) The potential winner fails to respond to any notification within the specified response period;\n\n(2) An email notification returns as undeliverable after 3 attempts;\n\n(3) Any non-email notification is returned a undeliverable;\n\n(4) The potential winner fails to provide satisfactory proof of age, identity or residency, as specified in the official rules;\n\n(5) The potential winner fails to execute and return the required documents within the specified return period;\n\n(6) The potential winner fails to be available to receive the prize;\n\n(7) The potential winner fails to validly claim the prize by the date specified in the prize award notification; or\n\n(8) Any other non-compliance with the official rules.\n\nSource. #6528, eff 6-27-97, rpld by #7404, eff 11-15-00\n\nNew. #9166, eff 5-31-08; ss by #12021, eff 10-27-16 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 6000)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot6000.html"
